WEBVTT

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.800
nearly every single one
of my patients died.

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:34.276
Everyone knows tobacco is bad,

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.355
but when you see the impact
firsthand, day-by-day,

00:00:37.379 --> 00:00:39.799
it leaves a very deep impression.

00:00:40.895 --> 00:00:44.172
Ten years later,
I'm a radiation oncologist,

00:00:44.196 --> 00:00:47.497
fully aware of the suffering
caused by tobacco.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:51.989
I'm sitting at the hospital cafeteria,
having my first ever meeting

00:00:52.013 --> 00:00:55.085
with a representative
from my superannuation fund.

00:00:55.109 --> 00:00:57.180
It was thrilling,
I'm sure you can imagine.

00:00:57.204 --> 00:00:58.744
(Laughter)

00:00:58.768 --> 00:01:01.379
He tells me I'm in the default option.